<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 13.5 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 13.5 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 13.5 percent of the workforce in January from 13.6 percent in December, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	   JANUARY    DECEMBER 96  JANUARY 96</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.34	 2.36	    2.72</p>
<p> pct of workforce		  13.5	 13.6	    15.4</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
